=================
 dbt7-build-dsgen
=================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-build-dsgen** [option...] directory

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-build-dsgen** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) TPC-DS Tools builder.
It applies the DBT-7 patches to the TPC-DS Tools source code and compiles
the tools.

OPTIONS
=======

--patch-dir=DIRECTORY  *directory* of patches to apply to the TPC-DS Tools,
        overrides the **PATCHDIR** environment variable, default
        */usr/share/dbt7/patches*.
-V, --version  Output version information, then exit.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

*directory* is the path to the TPC-DS Tools source code.

ENVIRONMENT
===========

**PATCHDIR**

    The directory of patches to apply to the TPC-DS Tools, default
    */usr/share/dbt7/patches*.  The --patch-dir option overrides this
    environment variable.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1)
